            <title>Tweetintosh 0.1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:08:48 GMT</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <sparkle:channel>preview</sparkle:channel>
            <link>https://github.com/ANNOnElysia/Tweetintosh/releases/tag/v0.1.1</link>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### English

- Updated multi-image support: increased the post photo attachment limit to 20, added an interactive bottom thumbnail scrubber in the image lightbox, and adjusted multi-image stream sizing and spacing to preserve aspect ratios without cropping.
- Fixed various bugs and improved stability.

### 中文

- 主要更新了对多图的支持：将发帖图片上限提升至 20 张，为图片灯箱新增底部缩略图居中滑动条，并优化了多图横向流的按比例展示与间距。
- 修复了一些 bug，提升了整体稳定性。
]]></description>
